WEBVTT

00:03.290 --> 00:05.000
Face me in humility...

00:08.080 --> 00:09.460
and sincerity.

00:12.580 --> 00:16.080
Maintain purity, be enamored with dignity.

00:17.080 --> 00:21.380
Maintain your allegiance, do not forsake the weak.

00:22.210 --> 00:23.880
Rise against peril.

00:26.290 --> 00:31.130
Always carry, embrace,
and hold your chest up with pride.

00:32.540 --> 00:36.290
Protect with your back and cut
through the darkness with your sword.

00:37.500 --> 00:39.790
Do not forget the oath you make on this day.

00:44.580 --> 00:48.920
Arthur Bersford, you have now become a knight.

00:59.630 --> 01:00.710
I'm sorry...

01:04.580 --> 01:06.210
I had you waiting for two years.

01:10.250 --> 01:11.460
Welcome home.

02:46.290 --> 02:49.290
<b>"The Coldhearted Princess and the Quitter"</b>

02:47.040 --> 02:48.500
Sorry, I'm late.

02:49.540 --> 02:51.040
We hardly waited.

02:51.540 --> 02:52.460
Oh, okay.

02:54.960 --> 02:56.830
Did something happen with that Chancellor?

02:59.540 --> 03:02.080
I was told yet again that I look like Gilbert.

03:02.330 --> 03:03.420
Ah, I get it.

03:04.130 --> 03:06.460
Speaking of, were you all right?

03:06.790 --> 03:07.500
Huh?

03:07.960 --> 03:11.540
He was persistently asking you about
something at the celebration, right?

03:11.880 --> 03:14.670
We just talked about my uncommon special ability.

03:16.960 --> 03:17.960
There was no problem.

03:18.540 --> 03:21.420
Stale, Arthur! Well done today!

03:21.420 --> 03:24.210
Hello, you two! What are you talking about?

03:24.580 --> 03:27.500
Ah, nothing important.

03:30.540 --> 03:32.130
Stale, can we talk a second?

03:35.130 --> 03:38.040
I thought I'd give you this after our bout.

03:44.790 --> 03:45.790
Glasses?

03:47.460 --> 03:50.580
If you're wondering how they'll look on you,
just put them on.

03:59.580 --> 04:01.830
Big Brother! They look so good on you!

04:01.830 --> 04:02.750
Do they?

04:03.210 --> 04:05.710
Yeah! Right, Big Sister?

04:06.540 --> 04:09.170
It was a shock, but they really do suit you.

04:09.540 --> 04:11.580
They're just your style and you look wonderful!

04:16.000 --> 04:18.330
But why glasses all of a sudden?

04:18.670 --> 04:21.960
I just thought they'd look good on him, since he's Stale.

04:26.920 --> 04:33.750
Princess Pride, would you mind
reconsidering my proposal once again?

04:34.710 --> 04:36.960
But we've already spoken
about it in front of the council...

04:36.960 --> 04:41.210
Princess Pride, you are the one who Her Majesty
the Queen trusts the most deeply right now.

04:41.750 --> 04:45.540
I am quite certain that with your help,
it will not be impossible.

04:45.540 --> 04:48.830
Gilbert, maybe you should ask me about such things?

04:51.330 --> 04:55.000
Your Highness... Well, if you insist.

04:56.880 --> 04:58.670
Pride, are you all right?

04:59.380 --> 05:00.790
Yes, I'm fine.

05:01.460 --> 05:02.830
I hope so.

05:04.040 --> 05:07.250
He's proposing a mandatory
special ability registration law.

05:07.670 --> 05:10.750
Making it mandatory for a person to report their special
ability

05:10.750 --> 05:15.040
as a way to control the people is something
I can't agree to from a human rights perspective.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.920
Why is he being so particular with this law?

05:19.330 --> 05:20.920
It sure is strange.

05:21.580 --> 05:23.500
Please be careful around Gilbert.

05:24.170 --> 05:28.380
From here on out especially, I'll be sure
to be with you when you meet with him...

05:30.210 --> 05:32.920
He's finally not addressing Gilbert with his title.

05:33.210 --> 05:37.920
If anything, in the game they were close enough
to work together to support the country, though...

05:39.000 --> 05:39.670
Wait...

05:40.750 --> 05:43.670
They worked together in the game? Eh?

05:43.880 --> 05:49.130
Then Chancellor Gilbert really was
in the game?! I can't remember...

05:51.000 --> 05:51.880
Stale?

05:51.880 --> 05:52.540
Yes?

05:54.130 --> 06:02.210
You told me that you can now teleport
an adult that weighs more than you, right?

06:02.710 --> 06:04.380
Yes, but what about it?

06:04.790 --> 06:07.880
Can you teleport to where
Chancellor Gilbert is right now?

06:08.130 --> 06:08.790
Huh?

06:09.290 --> 06:10.880
There's something I want to check on.

06:22.130 --> 06:23.500
That's enough, Gilbert!

06:24.920 --> 06:27.460
What do you mean by relentlessly targeting Pride?!

06:27.460 --> 06:31.920
I'm doing nothing of the sort,
it's just simple engagement in a lively conversation.

06:32.380 --> 06:36.460
However, though my wishes remain ungranted,

06:36.880 --> 06:41.170
the moment it was known that precognition
abided within beloved daughter Princess Pride,

06:41.540 --> 06:47.710
in a matter of days an admirable special ability
user named Prince Stale is found...

06:48.790 --> 06:51.000
I was slightly vexed.

06:52.540 --> 06:55.750
I'm sure I explained that the conditions
were different when it was Pride's turn.

06:56.250 --> 06:58.710
Yes, yes! That's absolutely right!

06:59.210 --> 07:03.540
You all are surely not cutting any corners!
I am grateful for that!

07:04.210 --> 07:08.790
It was very kind of you that,
though the law remained pending,

07:08.790 --> 07:14.080
simply by Princess Pride asking
repeatedly over several days,

07:14.210 --> 07:23.330
the royal family secretly overturned their customs
and allowed him to contact his birth mother!

07:23.920 --> 07:27.250
You're too loud! I told you this was top secret!

07:24.000 --> 07:26.540
Several days... repeatedly?

07:27.630 --> 07:30.210
That's why I kept it quiet!

07:30.920 --> 07:36.540
I have repaid this favor by believing your words
and those of Her Majesty the Queen,

07:37.000 --> 07:39.920
that you would find someone!

07:39.920 --> 07:44.880
Gilbert, I understand your struggles very well.
Both Rosa and I are doing all we can to-

07:45.750 --> 07:48.330
You could never understand! What...

07:48.710 --> 07:51.170
What could you possibly understand, Albert?!

07:51.880 --> 07:54.960
Of my... and her suffering?!

07:56.790 --> 08:02.210
Arthur Bersford...
He knew the rumors about that special ability user...

08:03.630 --> 08:08.750
I've only met people that can
make water evaporate or grow hair,

08:09.250 --> 08:11.040
but as for ones that are just rumors,

08:11.040 --> 08:15.920
I've heard of people making rainbows,
healing sicknesses, changing hands into guns...

08:16.830 --> 08:19.330
They truly are here, Albert!

08:20.080 --> 08:25.710
We have those special ability users in this country!
I'm sure if we look all through the land...

08:26.130 --> 08:27.250
Gilbert...

08:28.000 --> 08:29.130
Seven years...

08:29.670 --> 08:33.130
It's already been seven years since then! Albert...

08:34.130 --> 08:36.790
She's... Maria is...

08:38.250 --> 08:40.420
She's already a stone's throw from death!

08:41.290 --> 08:46.670
Just... one would be good.
If we can find just a single one...

08:47.540 --> 08:51.210
A special ability user that heals illnesses...!

09:08.330 --> 09:10.330
What... have you done...?

09:10.670 --> 09:14.080
Seems the rumor that you, the eternal youth,

09:14.080 --> 09:18.790
can no longer manipulate your age and
are stuck as an old man is true, Gilbert.

09:19.670 --> 09:24.080
I'm so pleased, and it's all thanks to your wonderful law.

09:24.500 --> 09:29.500
After all, in this country, I've truly
become a very special existence.

09:30.210 --> 09:32.130
Special existence?

09:32.540 --> 09:37.580
The rare special abilities in this world
will be at my beck and call.

09:39.960 --> 09:45.540
To be honest, I was thinking about making you choose
between a fealty contract or execution as well.

09:46.330 --> 09:49.040
But, I'll turn a blind eye to this.

09:50.000 --> 09:56.710
What a curse that you now have
to live forever in a body so unsightly!

09:58.290 --> 10:02.630
It truly is pathetic. All of this because of that virus!

10:10.170 --> 10:16.380
I'm sorry... it's all my fault... everyone... Maria!

10:23.290 --> 10:26.500
I remembered things from
her previous life again yesterday.

10:27.420 --> 10:29.130
It was about Chancellor Gilbert.

10:31.080 --> 10:37.880
Gilbert Butler. He's a secret character in ORL.
He was a talented strategist.

10:38.830 --> 10:43.920
What I haven't realized until now, is that
in the game he looked like an elderly man,

10:44.380 --> 10:49.500
and sometimes he'd appear as
a mysterious youth named Gil.

10:50.790 --> 10:56.330
Several years after he became a chancellor,
his fiancée contracted an incurable disease.

10:57.170 --> 11:01.210
After that, he began the search for
an ability user who can cure the disease.

11:01.880 --> 11:08.880
In exchange for five years of labor, Pride promised him
that she would enact a bill to find that ability user.

11:09.460 --> 11:13.830
After those five years, the law was enacted. However...

11:16.420 --> 11:18.130
the day after it was,

11:20.330 --> 11:22.290
his fiancée drew her last breath.

11:23.750 --> 11:27.670
Then, Pride, who had a grasp on
the special abilities of the nation,

11:28.080 --> 11:30.290
forced those users into subordination or death.

11:31.040 --> 11:36.210
Due to this, the Kingdom of Freesia
temporarily became bathed in blood.

11:36.920 --> 11:41.630
Chancellor Gilbert, due to his feelings of guilt
and the shock of losing his fiancée,

11:42.290 --> 11:49.170
was only able to manipulate his age to look like
either an elderly man or his 13-year-old self.

11:52.630 --> 11:55.000
The law conference was held yesterday.

11:55.750 --> 12:00.130
It's the day in-game that the Mandatory
Special Ability Registration Law was passed.

12:01.170 --> 12:05.830
His fiancée passed at sunset,
the day after this law was enacted.

12:06.630 --> 12:11.630
Enacting a law normally takes a week until
after approval, and at most a month.

12:12.670 --> 12:14.460
I need to help before then.

12:15.670 --> 12:16.960
You all are to be in the rear garden.

12:16.960 --> 12:17.500
Yes, sir!

12:17.500 --> 12:19.330
And you all, search the east side.

12:18.920 --> 12:20.790
Has something happened?

12:19.330 --> 12:20.040
Right away.

12:20.790 --> 12:21.670
And make it thorough.

12:21.670 --> 12:22.290
Yes, sir!

12:22.290 --> 12:23.000
Father.

12:23.710 --> 12:25.920
What has happened to cause all of this commotion?

12:28.000 --> 12:31.670
Chancellor Gilbert hasn't been seen anywhere
in the castle since this morning.

12:36.210 --> 12:37.170
Big Brother,

12:37.330 --> 12:42.790
is it okay to keep from Father that you can go to
where Chancellor Gilbert is with your special ability?

12:42.790 --> 12:45.540
Yes, thank you for keeping it a secret.

12:46.210 --> 12:49.420
I hope Chancellor Gilbert is safe.

12:50.210 --> 12:53.130
I am worried about if I'm doing something bad, though.

12:53.540 --> 12:54.170
Huh?

12:57.170 --> 13:01.710
Tiara, don't be alarmed. To tell the truth, Gilbert...

13:01.710 --> 13:04.750
Both Stale and Tiara truly are kind people.

13:05.710 --> 13:09.880
Every time something like this happens,
they make sure to check with me.

13:10.540 --> 13:13.750
In comparison, when it came to game Pride,

13:14.130 --> 13:17.960
she would decide on execution or war or the like
without listening to the opinion of those around her...

13:19.380 --> 13:20.250
Huh?

13:29.460 --> 13:30.540
What's happened?

13:31.080 --> 13:32.630
Lotte! Marie! Jacques!

13:32.630 --> 13:33.580
Yes, Princess!

13:34.290 --> 13:35.420
I need you for something!

13:36.040 --> 13:41.170
The diabolical, egocentric, last boss Queen Pride
would never care about the opinion of another.

13:41.830 --> 13:44.540
The day that execution is chosen is
the same day it will happen.

13:44.790 --> 13:48.580
She would not wait a week until that law is enacted!

13:49.000 --> 13:52.790
Which means, Chancellor Gilbert's fiancée will die...

13:54.670 --> 13:56.040
today at sunset!

14:00.210 --> 14:05.380
This man is good to pay up every time. I guarantee it.

14:05.880 --> 14:08.630
After all, he's a big wig at the castle.

14:09.670 --> 14:12.210
I will leave the methods and means up to you.

14:12.210 --> 14:16.250
If your information can be confirmed, I will pay you.

14:17.710 --> 14:21.040
If necessary, get intel on the royal family or anyone else.

14:21.540 --> 14:24.880
Okay then, what's the special ability you're after?

14:25.290 --> 14:29.210
One that can cure illness. Find someone who can do tha-

14:30.580 --> 14:31.750
What's so funny?

14:31.960 --> 14:34.580
An ability that can cure illness?

14:34.580 --> 14:36.830
Which children's book did you find somethin' like that in?

14:38.580 --> 14:40.790
If you have no intention on searching
then you are of no use to me.

14:41.460 --> 14:44.750
Hold on. Leave that pouch here.

14:45.330 --> 14:47.750
I do not pay for uselessness.

14:48.790 --> 14:50.080
Have it your way, then!

14:53.670 --> 14:54.380
Damn!

14:57.250 --> 14:58.170
Why you-!

15:08.170 --> 15:09.000
You two!

15:12.000 --> 15:14.960
We came looking for you. What were you doing?

15:16.250 --> 15:18.750
Though, there seems to be no point in my asking.

15:20.250 --> 15:21.540
Why are you here?

15:22.000 --> 15:24.790
Chancellor Gilbert, please calm down and listen.

15:25.790 --> 15:27.000
I had a premonition.

15:28.080 --> 15:29.420
Your fiancée...

15:30.040 --> 15:32.830
Miss Marianne will die today.

15:48.790 --> 15:56.170
I was originally born of a lower status, and after
my parents died, I begged, had affairs, stole...

15:56.170 --> 15:57.380
I did everything.

15:57.920 --> 16:02.710
I obtained the money I needed to live that day.
That was all my days were comprised of.

16:16.920 --> 16:18.080
Good evening.

16:19.880 --> 16:23.580
That was my first encounter with Marianne.

16:26.000 --> 16:32.080
She was the third daughter of a Count, and since
her health had been in decline until two years earlier,

16:32.380 --> 16:36.880
she had been confined to her room,
and at night she'd frequently go outside in secret.

16:38.130 --> 16:41.380
But you're the first person I've met.

16:42.040 --> 16:45.290
Are you okay being so defenseless out here?

16:45.290 --> 16:46.000
Huh?

16:46.460 --> 16:49.710
What if I tried to harm you?

16:50.580 --> 16:54.170
Do you wish to harm me?

16:54.290 --> 16:55.210
What?

16:55.750 --> 16:57.080
I don't mind.

16:57.710 --> 17:01.290
Whether you take my life, or whatever you may do...

17:02.000 --> 17:06.290
as long as you become happy enough for me, too.

17:08.460 --> 17:10.080
What do you mean by...

17:10.080 --> 17:15.960
Or instead, whatever view
you find most people in the world...

17:17.080 --> 17:18.960
please bring me there.

17:37.540 --> 17:40.790
I've never seen anything this beautiful before!

17:41.500 --> 17:44.710
Can I bring you here again in three days?

17:49.500 --> 17:50.830
Really?

17:55.170 --> 17:56.880
If that's what you would like.

18:03.540 --> 18:05.040
That's a promise.

18:06.830 --> 18:11.630
After I got involved with her, I grew ashamed
of the way I was living at the time.

18:12.920 --> 18:16.500
I had a meager income,
but I got a job I could tell others about,

18:17.130 --> 18:23.380
and every three days, I found a reason to live in just
exchanging words with her, and I continued working.

18:25.960 --> 18:30.080
Gil, I... I have a fiancé now.

18:30.790 --> 18:31.460
Huh?

18:31.460 --> 18:35.250
So I thought I would tell you this before it's too late.

18:38.420 --> 18:39.330
Gil...

18:41.420 --> 18:43.750
I love you.

18:44.210 --> 18:46.210
I have for a long time.

18:56.210 --> 19:00.750
In four years... Until I turn 16...

19:02.960 --> 19:08.000
Until I can't see you anymore,
please, keep coming to see me.

19:12.460 --> 19:17.130
I was awakened to my special ability
after those few weeks.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.170
Eternal youth.

19:19.670 --> 19:24.210
I was an extremely rare special ability user,
who could even manipulate my own life span.

19:25.170 --> 19:28.580
To me, this was a gift from God.

19:30.170 --> 19:32.460
Why won't I be able to see you for a while?

19:32.880 --> 19:37.290
I'll come for you. I'll make sure of it, before you're 16!

19:39.460 --> 19:40.460
I'll be waiting.

19:50.080 --> 19:54.830
Gilbert Butler, do you wish to become my advisor,
as I become the Prince Consort?

19:55.000 --> 19:55.960
Yes, I do!

19:56.080 --> 20:02.040
You... no, Your Highness, I will support and
serve you with all I have for my entire life!

20:02.500 --> 20:05.750
We now acknowledge you as our nation's chancellor.

20:10.460 --> 20:14.170
I am quite pleased to meet you. Lady Marianne Edwards.

20:15.460 --> 20:20.960
I am Gilbert Butler, and I serve
as the chancellor of this nation.

20:22.040 --> 20:24.790
Please, call me Gil.

20:25.460 --> 20:30.790
I apologize for being so sudden,
but if you would like, please marry me.

20:31.790 --> 20:34.670
I promise I will make you happy.

20:38.920 --> 20:44.250
I am Marianne Edwards. Please, call me Maria.

20:45.460 --> 20:49.130
I happily accept... Gil!

20:51.080 --> 20:56.290
I knew. I knew that I was brought into
this world only for the sake of meeting her.

20:58.420 --> 21:01.380
Those days were more than enough.

21:10.880 --> 21:14.380
She collapsed due to her illness,
and even when that happened...

21:16.170 --> 21:23.330
If I die, live a good life, for the both of us.

21:24.330 --> 21:28.710
What are you saying, Maria?!
I'm going to cure your illness!

21:29.420 --> 21:33.630
I will do anything it takes!
No matter who I make an enemy of!

21:34.880 --> 21:39.920
Gil... I am... already more than happ-

21:39.920 --> 21:43.790
I'm not! I haven't been able to make you happy!

21:47.460 --> 21:50.580
Maria?! Maria, Maria!

21:51.330 --> 21:52.460
Maria!

23:29.080 --> 23:34.210
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:35.130 --> 23:38.210
Episode 8: "The Insolent Princess and Judgment".

23:36.000 --> 23:41.040
<b>"The Insolent Princess and Judgment"</b>
